* Strong-low DAC zero Norton source vs leakage conductance
Vlo lo 0 0
.model ADC adc_bridge(in_low=2.1 in_high=2.2 rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n time_tol=1p out_low=0 out_high=5 clamp_low=0 clamp_high=5 clamp_res=10 clamp_bias=.5 out_family="HC")
.model DAC0 dac_bridge(in_family="HC" out_low=0 out_high=5 g_pullup=.024 g_pulldown=.034 g_resistive=.001 g_hiz=0 input_load=0 t_rise=1n t_fall=1n knee_low=2 knee_high=2.75 v_smooth=.5)
Aadc0 lo dig0 ADC
Adac0 dig0 q0 DAC0
Vforce0 q0 0 PWL(0 0 1n 0 2n .5 3n .5 4n 1 5n 1 6n 2 7n 2 8n 0 9n 0)
